fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gst-editing-services/gesclip.html#ges_clip_is_moving_between_layers","fragment":"\n\tges_clip_is_moving_between_layers\n\n\n\tGES.Clip.prototype.is_moving_between_layers\n\n\n\tGES.Clip.is_moving_between_layers\n\nTells you if the clip is currently in the process of being moved from\none layer to another. This is useful from the layer::clip-added and\nlayer::clip-removed callbacks to know if the clip is being moved between\nlayers, or is being added/removed for other reasons (like being added\nfor the first time, or being actually removed).\nParameters:\nA GESClip\nTRUE if clip is currently being moved between layers,\nFALSE otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nTells you if the clip is currently in the process of being moved from\none layer to another. This is useful from the layer::clip-added and\nlayer::clip-removed callbacks to know if the clip is being moved between\nlayers, or is being added/removed for other reasons (like being added\nfor the first time, or being actually removed).\nParameters:\nA GES.Clip\ntrue if clip is currently being moved between layers,\nfalse otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nTells you if the clip is currently in the process of being moved from\none layer to another. This is useful from the layer::clip-added and\nlayer::clip-removed callbacks to know if the clip is being moved between\nlayers, or is being added/removed for other reasons (like being added\nfor the first time, or being actually removed).\nParameters:\nA GES.Clip\nTrue if clip is currently being moved between layers,\nFalse otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});